OL,3,GNEWSAPolice treating house fire as
OL,4,Aarson
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say they are treating an
OL,7,Fearly-morning fire at a house in Bangor
OL,8,Fas arson with intent to endanger life.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to home
OL,11,Fin the Balloo Walk area of the city at
OL,12,Faround 05.30 BST and the fire was then
OL,13,Fextinguished.
OL,15,FExtensive damage was caused to rooms
OL,16,Finside the property, but no one was
OL,17,Finside the house at the time and there
OL,18,Fwere no reports of injuries.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
