OL,3,GNEWSAPolice treating house fire as
OL,4,Aarson
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Sgt Crossett said:"We are treating
OL,7,Fthis report as arson with intent to
OL,8,Fendanger life, and enquiries are
OL,9,Fongoing today to determine a motive and
OL,10,Fwho was involved."
